WEBVTT

00:00:07.450 --> 00:00:10.540
Administrator Privileges! Aide Summon!

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:15.330
"Isami Tahara"
Isami Tahara! I command you to appear before me!

00:00:32.660 --> 00:00:36.540
Huh? Well if it isn't the Chief.

00:00:36.540 --> 00:00:38.160
Where the hell is this?!

00:00:39.660 --> 00:00:42.250
"Genius" "Isami Tahara"
Yeah, that's Tahara all right...

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:44.000
"Hakuto Kunai"

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:46.290
I'm glad that you've come, Tahara.

00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:50.410
Let's get ourselves somewhere
we can sit down and talk.

00:00:50.410 --> 00:00:52.200
R-Right...

00:00:56.330 --> 00:01:00.830
<i>Open your eyes</i>

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:07.370
<i>Dwelling in the eyes of</i>
<i>that majestic figure are wishes</i>

00:01:07.370 --> 00:01:11.000
<i>Let's sing to the sleepless night</i>

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:14.290
<i>Dramatically pull everything in,</i>
<i>even light and darkness</i>

00:01:14.290 --> 00:01:17.700
<i>In order to smile again tomorrow, unafraid</i>

00:01:19.580 --> 00:01:26.500
<i>I learned that true kindness is</i>
<i>actually solitude after looking at you</i>

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:33.000
<i>I wanted to get closer to your heart</i>
<i>and yet it's still so far away</i>

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:39.830
<i>No matter what fate gets in my way,</i>
<i>I'll face it head on</i>

00:01:39.830 --> 00:01:47.080
<i>With the bravery I chose with you,</i>
<i>let's flap our wings and fly</i>

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:52.410
<i>My heart is trembling with the hope that I found</i>

00:01:52.410 --> 00:01:55.870
<i>Resounding inside me</i>
<i>move my heart</i>

00:01:55.870 --> 00:01:59.290
<i>Lurking behind my hidden true motives</i>

00:01:59.290 --> 00:02:02.750
<i>With a stronger gaze than anyone else</i>

00:02:02.750 --> 00:02:06.040
<i>Dwelling in the eyes of</i>
<i>that majestic figure are wishes</i>

00:02:06.040 --> 00:02:09.660
<i>Let's sing to the sleepless night</i>

00:02:09.660 --> 00:02:12.830
<i>Dramatically pull everything in,</i>
<i>even light and darkness</i>

00:02:12.830 --> 00:02:16.410
<i>In order to smile again tomorrow, unafraid</i>

00:02:16.410 --> 00:02:18.040
<i>Let's begin</i>

00:02:18.040 --> 00:02:20.040
<i>Open your eyes</i>

00:02:22.950 --> 00:02:27.950
"Dancing Swindler and the Giant Gold Coin"

00:02:35.330 --> 00:02:39.830
Is this a new <i>Infinity Game </i>arena or something?

00:02:39.830 --> 00:02:43.200
As always, they sure blew tons of money...

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:46.620
Hmm... There's one thing I should mention.

00:02:46.620 --> 00:02:50.660
This isn't a world where the
Great Empire is known to exist.

00:02:50.660 --> 00:02:51.700
Huh?

00:02:55.950 --> 00:02:57.660
What is it, then?

00:02:57.660 --> 00:03:04.000
Some sort of fantasy world like in
the anime I watched when I was a kid?

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:06.410
Putting it bluntly, it's something like that.

00:03:12.330 --> 00:03:16.790
I bet Tahara's head is churning
away at incredible speed...

00:03:16.790 --> 00:03:20.790
...and coming up with a whole
slew of theories and ideas.

00:03:22.080 --> 00:03:27.160
Well, I know you wouldn't pull
a prank like this in a million years.

00:03:27.160 --> 00:03:29.370
By the way, Yu is here too.

00:03:29.370 --> 00:03:33.830
Gah! That mad woman?! You're kidding me!

00:03:33.830 --> 00:03:36.450
I need you to cooperate with her.

00:03:36.450 --> 00:03:41.250
Did you drop your left arm?
Or perhaps your right arm?

00:03:41.250 --> 00:03:44.410
B-Both.... I think?

00:03:44.410 --> 00:03:46.830
Oh, you're such a greedy one.

00:03:46.830 --> 00:03:49.870
But I'll do you a special service today!

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:57.750
Oops, I'm sorry. I think I mixed up
your right and left arms.

00:03:57.750 --> 00:04:01.620
W-Wait a sec! This is no laughing matter!

00:04:04.620 --> 00:04:07.660
She's a pretty thing, but so damn scary...

00:04:07.660 --> 00:04:10.580
Why did I make her like that in the first place?

00:04:10.580 --> 00:04:14.410
Hey, Chief. Mind if I clear something up?

00:04:14.410 --> 00:04:15.660
What is it?

00:04:15.660 --> 00:04:20.700
Are you serious about the Great Empire
not existing in this world?

00:04:20.700 --> 00:04:24.250
It's true beyond any doubt.

00:04:24.250 --> 00:04:27.700
If this really is a world
without the Great Empire,

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:30.410
nothing else could make me happier.

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:32.540
One more thing to ask.

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:35.160
What do you plan to do in this world?

00:04:35.160 --> 00:04:38.250
I can't say very much at this point.

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:44.200
But, I'm thinking of going in the opposite
direction of the Great Empire.

00:04:44.200 --> 00:04:47.120
Yeah? Well, whatever.

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:51.410
If it weren't for you,
Manami and I would have died like dogs.

00:04:51.410 --> 00:04:56.660
Manami, the little sister Tahara
gets his serious sister complex from...

00:04:56.660 --> 00:04:57.660
Big brother!

00:04:57.660 --> 00:04:58.750
Manami!

00:04:58.750 --> 00:04:59.790
Big brother!

00:04:59.790 --> 00:05:00.910
Manami!

00:05:00.910 --> 00:05:02.160
Big brother!

00:05:02.160 --> 00:05:04.580
Manami!

00:05:04.580 --> 00:05:07.120
So? What's the plan for the time being?

00:05:07.120 --> 00:05:10.370
First up is managing an impoverished village.

00:05:10.370 --> 00:05:15.950
Its three attractions are a field hospital,
hot spring resort, and a bath house.

00:05:15.950 --> 00:05:20.410
You'll need to develop the whole village,
teach and train the residents,

00:05:20.410 --> 00:05:24.000
secure a profitable business,
manage any trouble,

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:27.950
negotiate with nobles, watch the kids, also...

00:05:27.950 --> 00:05:32.200
Don't be ridiculous!
I'm not some blue robotic cat, you know!

00:05:32.200 --> 00:05:35.660
But you're a genius. You can do it.

00:05:35.660 --> 00:05:38.250
It's me saying it, so it's true.

00:05:41.620 --> 00:05:43.040
What's wrong?

00:05:43.040 --> 00:05:47.450
I-It felt like I got zapped. What the hell?

00:05:47.450 --> 00:05:51.000
Could something be wrong with you?
Have Yu take a look.

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:56.500
Gimme a break. The day she checks
my health is the day I'm cut into pieces.

00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:59.500
You have quite the impression of me, Tahara.

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:00.040
Gah!

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:01.450
"Yu Kirino"

00:06:01.700 --> 00:06:06.250
The mad woman! I mean, if it isn't Yu!

00:06:06.250 --> 00:06:08.540
Long time no see, Tahara.

00:06:10.080 --> 00:06:13.120
"Tron" "Aku" "Luna Elegant"
Demon Lord, who's this new person with you?

00:06:13.120 --> 00:06:15.790
"Tron" "Aku" "Luna Elegant"
He looks kind of perverted to me.

00:06:17.410 --> 00:06:19.700
Are you one of Demon Lord's lackeys?

00:06:19.700 --> 00:06:22.500
Such a pretty color. You must be kind.

00:06:22.500 --> 00:06:24.160
I wouldn't say that.

00:06:25.080 --> 00:06:29.540
Now then, all that's left is to make
preparations to welcome Madam.

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:39.450
"Nanden Mannen"

00:06:42.660 --> 00:06:46.950
Oh, my. What sort of magical device is this?

00:06:46.950 --> 00:06:52.750
Don't get too excited just yet.
It even has a second key to wind.

00:06:54.790 --> 00:06:58.120
Is this another item of yours from overseas?

00:06:59.250 --> 00:07:00.580
That's correct.

00:07:01.540 --> 00:07:07.700
In my country, letting this play on
cold winter nights while sipping on wine...

00:07:07.700 --> 00:07:11.750
...is a practice often enjoyed by the refined.

00:07:11.750 --> 00:07:14.660
I must say, it's a masterpiece.

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:18.160
To think you can enjoy music
so easily with this...

00:07:18.160 --> 00:07:21.540
...without a musician,
let alone any instruments.

00:07:21.540 --> 00:07:25.870
For balls and high society,
of course you'll still need those.

00:07:25.870 --> 00:07:31.000
However, if alone in your room
or for small gatherings of people,

00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:34.830
this is much less invasive
and is the smart choice.

00:07:34.830 --> 00:07:38.790
Also, carrying it around is incredibly easy.

00:07:38.790 --> 00:07:43.290
It's not very elegant to
march around with an orchestra.

00:07:43.290 --> 00:07:47.450
So, what would an item like this be valued at?

00:07:47.450 --> 00:07:53.330
I'd actually prefer if you determined
the value this time, Mr. Mannen.

00:07:53.330 --> 00:07:59.200
Wh-Where do I even start judging
the value of this marvelous device?

00:07:59.200 --> 00:08:03.910
If I price it too poorly,
he may turn his back on me...

00:08:03.910 --> 00:08:08.370
In your country, I imagine this
runs a high price, does it not?

00:08:08.370 --> 00:08:13.870
Typically, when it comes to valuing
art and items of this nature,

00:08:13.870 --> 00:08:19.500
its worth varies greatly like beauty
in the eye of the beholder.

00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:23.370
I-I knew it. Is he testing me then?

00:08:23.370 --> 00:08:28.450
To be perfectly honest, when you
first offered me this item for auction,

00:08:28.450 --> 00:08:34.250
I couldn't even imagine
how much it must be worth.

00:08:34.250 --> 00:08:37.330
Then you believe it has tremendous value?

00:08:37.330 --> 00:08:39.250
Of course I do!

00:08:39.250 --> 00:08:44.410
It wouldn't take much to find someone
wanting a curious item such as this!

00:08:44.410 --> 00:08:45.830
I see...

00:08:45.830 --> 00:08:51.540
In that case, what's the least you think
it might sell for if it were up for auction?

00:08:51.540 --> 00:08:56.080
It's time! This is where he plans
to make his decision...

00:08:56.080 --> 00:09:02.080
If I screw this up, I imagine Mr. Kunai
will take this device to another store.

00:09:02.080 --> 00:09:04.200
I'll lose out on more than this.

00:09:04.200 --> 00:09:08.790
He might take all his future
business somewhere else too.

00:09:08.790 --> 00:09:12.790
If it were me, I'd start at
no less than 15 gold coins.

00:09:12.790 --> 00:09:19.410
Someone who can't afford that much
has no business at an auction.

00:09:19.410 --> 00:09:25.120
You have such a discerning eye.
I was right to put my faith in you.

00:09:28.370 --> 00:09:31.830
Mr. Kunai! We're so glad to have you!

00:09:31.830 --> 00:09:34.120
"Bingo"
Welcome him, everybody!

00:09:34.120 --> 00:09:35.790
Welcome to our shop!

00:09:38.120 --> 00:09:44.410
Sir, would you be able to make
20 of each of these outfits for me?

00:09:44.410 --> 00:09:46.500
One moment, please, while I look.

00:09:48.450 --> 00:09:53.620
The tuxedos on their own
shouldn't be that difficult to make...

00:09:53.620 --> 00:09:57.120
But these suits and tights made for women?!

00:09:57.120 --> 00:10:00.250
What a lascivious and stimulating design!

00:10:00.250 --> 00:10:04.830
Who does stitched tights like this?!
My goodness!

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:07.750
Sure, we can make these no problem.

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:12.790
Great. But this time, I need it done
as quickly as possible.

00:10:12.790 --> 00:10:17.370
As soon as you finish these,
I want them sent to Rabby Village.

00:10:17.370 --> 00:10:21.950
I understand you want it done quickly,
but these will take some time to make.

00:10:21.950 --> 00:10:25.540
I've prepared some money
to compensate for the rush.

00:10:28.040 --> 00:10:30.660
This is only a payment in advance.

00:10:30.660 --> 00:10:34.790
If you complete the work quickly,
I can add another two.

00:10:34.790 --> 00:10:37.830
Can you do it? Tell me you can!

00:10:37.830 --> 00:10:43.200
We can! We'll rush to deliver it
down to the very last second!

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:47.620
Excellent. I must ask that
you begin work at once.

00:10:47.620 --> 00:10:51.000
Everyone, it's time for battle! Run!

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:52.000
Right!

00:10:55.080 --> 00:10:56.910
Thank you very much!

00:10:59.700 --> 00:11:03.370
Bread, milk, vegetables, meat, and eggs...

00:11:03.370 --> 00:11:08.120
Good. Now food will get
delivered to Rabby every so often.

00:11:08.120 --> 00:11:13.870
The expenses added up, but I've still
got three gold coins left over after all this.

00:11:13.870 --> 00:11:17.830
We should be able to manage things
for a while with that much.

00:11:17.830 --> 00:11:20.410
Everything's pretty much ready now.

00:11:35.580 --> 00:11:39.370
"Zero Kirisame"
I wonder how I would best describe this feeling.

00:11:39.370 --> 00:11:44.500
If Kunai's my family home,
Zero's my room after moving out...

00:11:44.500 --> 00:11:49.160
Looking back, I used him so much
during the heyday of the game.

00:11:49.160 --> 00:11:52.870
You could even say we've been
partners for some ten years.

00:11:58.540 --> 00:12:01.830
This feeling swelling up from deep inside...

00:12:01.830 --> 00:12:05.080
To crush the strong and help out the weak...

00:12:05.080 --> 00:12:08.250
To face my opponents no matter who they are...

00:12:08.250 --> 00:12:12.950
That fierce desire to be a hero
within every man...

00:12:12.950 --> 00:12:17.620
It's as if he's really a...
No, like I'm a dragon after all.

00:12:20.330 --> 00:12:23.080
My entire body is throbbing...

00:12:23.080 --> 00:12:28.000
I'll bust everything in my way.
I'm the strongest one alive!

00:12:28.000 --> 00:12:31.160
You've got it coming, fucking Great Empire.

00:12:34.410 --> 00:12:37.540
I need to learn how to revert at will.

00:12:40.000 --> 00:12:45.000
"Isami Tahara" "Race: Human" "Sex: Male"
"Age: 31" "Height: 182cm"

00:12:45.000 --> 00:12:50.000
"Commando Sambo" "Race: Human" "Sex: Male"
"Age: ?" "Height: ?"

00:12:57.750 --> 00:13:00.450
"Momo"

00:13:01.160 --> 00:13:02.160
Guys!

00:13:03.080 --> 00:13:04.750
"Kyon"
Let's have lunch, hop!

00:13:08.540 --> 00:13:11.870
--So good!
--It's delicious!

00:13:11.870 --> 00:13:13.370
Looks tasty!

00:13:15.080 --> 00:13:17.750
Kyon, let's go freshen up, bunny!

00:13:17.750 --> 00:13:19.580
Good idea. Let's go, hop!

00:13:23.950 --> 00:13:25.500
It's time to cleanse you with water!

00:13:25.500 --> 00:13:26.620
More water, please!

00:13:26.620 --> 00:13:30.120
I'll douse you in water and make you repent!

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:35.160
I'm so happy we can wash the sweat
away even during our breaks, hop!

00:13:35.160 --> 00:13:39.450
It's a dream come true to get to use
the soap and baths as we please, bunny!

00:13:48.120 --> 00:13:49.410
"Hot Spring Resort"

00:13:49.950 --> 00:13:53.700
All right, I've taught you
everything you need to know.

00:13:53.700 --> 00:13:57.200
Now all that's left is to put it into practice.

00:13:57.200 --> 00:13:58.290
Let's begin.

00:14:00.040 --> 00:14:02.160
Whoa, whoa, hold up.

00:14:02.160 --> 00:14:07.250
Remember I said how to sweep up
the trash before you start brushing?

00:14:07.250 --> 00:14:10.120
Forget that and you'll just make a bigger mess.

00:14:10.120 --> 00:14:12.870
S-Sorry, Mr. Tahara.

00:14:12.870 --> 00:14:15.540
It's fine. Mistakes happen.

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:19.290
But repeating the same mistakes
is plain negligence...

00:14:19.290 --> 00:14:21.700
...and proves you weren't paying attention.

00:14:21.700 --> 00:14:23.910
Let's be more careful, all right?

00:14:26.660 --> 00:14:27.250
"Women's Bath"
"Men's Bath"

00:14:27.250 --> 00:14:28.660
"Women's Bath"

00:14:38.830 --> 00:14:41.500
Bunny suits for a hot spring resort?

00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:45.250
At first, I wasn't so sure about it,
but it's growing on me.

00:14:45.250 --> 00:14:48.200
It sure helps that you're really bunny people.

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:52.250
Ugh, th-these clothes are so embarrassing, hop.

00:14:52.250 --> 00:14:54.200
You guys are perverts, bunny.

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:59.000
You'll get used to it.
Try shaking your butt for some extra service.

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:00.580
No way, hop!

00:15:00.580 --> 00:15:02.950
No bunny for you, sonny!

00:15:02.950 --> 00:15:06.750
Anyways, it's time to review
how to greet customers.

00:15:06.750 --> 00:15:10.830
Give a nice, firm bow
and hold it for three seconds.

00:15:10.830 --> 00:15:13.410
And don't forget to smile and speak clearly.

00:15:15.580 --> 00:15:18.120
Thank you for coming, hop!

00:15:18.120 --> 00:15:20.580
Thank you for coming, bunny!

00:15:20.580 --> 00:15:22.080
Better!

00:15:22.080 --> 00:15:24.450
Just imagine Manami in a bunny suit...

00:15:25.540 --> 00:15:27.700
Thanks for coming, big brother!

00:15:31.120 --> 00:15:33.450
"One week later"

00:15:36.410 --> 00:15:38.830
"Shrimpfry Butterfly"

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:42.620
Allow me to welcome you, Madam.

00:15:46.450 --> 00:15:49.200
As usual, what a wonderful man.

00:15:49.200 --> 00:15:51.950
This is such a pleasant little village.

00:15:51.950 --> 00:15:54.500
It's much different than the rumors say.

00:15:54.500 --> 00:15:58.700
No, no... We've only just begun
to transform this place.

00:15:58.700 --> 00:16:03.000
Give it a month or two and it will
look much better than this.

00:16:03.000 --> 00:16:06.950
Come back then and you'll think
you died and went to heaven.

00:16:06.950 --> 00:16:12.000
Everything you've shown me thus far
has truly lived up to your word.

00:16:12.000 --> 00:16:14.120
It's this right here.

00:16:14.120 --> 00:16:15.660
Soap?

00:16:15.660 --> 00:16:19.160
Oh! That soap is the best thing ever!

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:23.620
It washes away dirt like magic
and leaves your skin sparkling!

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:27.000
Magic... Sparkling, huh?

00:16:28.450 --> 00:16:30.370
That soap was a hit.

00:16:30.370 --> 00:16:34.410
Oh? Is this the village you
were talking about, Madam?

00:16:38.250 --> 00:16:39.910
Good grief, Gramps.

00:16:39.910 --> 00:16:40.620
Hmm?

00:16:40.620 --> 00:16:44.870
I told you to wait until I called for you.

00:16:44.870 --> 00:16:47.500
Old folk like me don't like waiting.

00:16:47.500 --> 00:16:50.790
Madam, who is this gentleman?

00:16:50.790 --> 00:16:55.200
This decrepit old man causing nothing
but trouble is Commando Sambo.

00:16:55.200 --> 00:16:58.040
As you can see, he has bad eyes.

00:16:58.040 --> 00:17:04.620
I brought him along to show him a good time
since he doesn't have long left.

00:17:04.620 --> 00:17:08.040
"Retired Soldier" "Commando Sambo"
Your mouth is as rotten as ever, Madam.

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:10.660
Can't you show your elders some respect?

00:17:10.660 --> 00:17:12.500
Shut your mouth, Gramps.

00:17:12.500 --> 00:17:16.830
I see... Judging by the cloth
covering your eyes,

00:17:16.830 --> 00:17:19.830
I imagine your condition is quite serious.

00:17:19.830 --> 00:17:23.580
You must be the man Madam was speaking about.

00:17:23.580 --> 00:17:28.080
I'm a former retainer of Marshall Arts
and Sambo is my name.

00:17:28.080 --> 00:17:30.540
Arts? Who was that again?

00:17:30.540 --> 00:17:34.200
Oh? The renowned Master Arts, you say?

00:17:34.200 --> 00:17:37.750
I'm sure your exploits
must have been great and many.

00:17:37.750 --> 00:17:44.410
Yes, but several years ago,
a magical beast took both of my eyes.

00:17:44.410 --> 00:17:48.450
I've since had to retire
as I'm no use to anyone now.

00:17:48.450 --> 00:17:50.700
It must've been tough for you.

00:17:50.700 --> 00:17:54.790
A subordinate of mine is
an exceptional doctor, actually.

00:17:54.790 --> 00:17:58.330
She might be able to completely heal your eyes.

00:17:58.330 --> 00:18:01.370
A-Are you serious about that?

00:18:01.370 --> 00:18:04.120
If you wish, I'll take you to her.

00:18:04.120 --> 00:18:09.540
Please do! Even if there's only
a slim chance, I can hope...

00:18:09.540 --> 00:18:12.290
You're being such a bothersome old man.

00:18:12.290 --> 00:18:16.330
I'm sorry about this.
We're only making more work for you.

00:18:16.330 --> 00:18:19.160
It's no problem in the slightest.

00:18:19.160 --> 00:18:21.660
Go on and guide him, Tahara.

00:18:21.660 --> 00:18:23.580
This way, Master Sambo.

00:18:23.580 --> 00:18:24.580
Okay...

00:18:25.500 --> 00:18:26.830
"Message"
Yu.

00:18:26.830 --> 00:18:28.290
"Message"
On it, Chief.

00:18:36.660 --> 00:18:41.200
Welcome, Madam and Master Sambo.

00:18:41.200 --> 00:18:45.830
This feels like I've stumbled
into another world or something...

00:18:48.330 --> 00:18:51.700
Hurry up, Gramps. Have her take a look already.

00:18:51.700 --> 00:18:55.580
You meddling woman.
A man like me won't run away.

00:18:55.580 --> 00:18:58.500
Get on with it, you senile old man!

00:18:58.500 --> 00:19:02.790
Master Sambo, are you ready
to begin the examination?

00:19:04.250 --> 00:19:09.000
I'm so sorry, Ma'am,
for showing you such a ghastly thing.

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:12.790
The venom of a Scarecrow did this to me.

00:19:12.790 --> 00:19:14.080
I see.

00:19:14.080 --> 00:19:18.790
These days, I can only see
the outline of people at best.

00:19:18.790 --> 00:19:22.540
I'd be so grateful if you can
make it any better.

00:19:22.540 --> 00:19:24.370
Rest assured.

00:19:24.370 --> 00:19:29.870
In the country I'm from, we have
a medicine that treats your symptoms.

00:19:29.870 --> 00:19:33.000
Oh, Ma'am! Are you serious?

00:19:33.000 --> 00:19:35.000
Yes, please wait a moment.

00:19:40.080 --> 00:19:43.790
She plans to just use medicine to cure his eyes.

00:19:43.790 --> 00:19:49.000
After all, it might be a bit too much
to show Madam her "Hand of God."

00:19:59.000 --> 00:20:00.540
Please look up.

00:20:00.540 --> 00:20:01.750
Like this?

00:20:07.250 --> 00:20:10.910
Master Sambo, slowly open your eyes, please.

00:20:16.540 --> 00:20:21.950
I can see! I can see!
My eyes are back to normal!

00:20:21.950 --> 00:20:24.370
Gramps, are you serious?

00:20:24.370 --> 00:20:28.450
Oh, Madam! You've fattened up
since I last saw you!

00:20:28.450 --> 00:20:31.120
What did you eat to get so big?

00:20:31.120 --> 00:20:33.950
Would you shut up, you walking corpse?!

00:20:37.580 --> 00:20:40.830
I can see out of my eyes! I can see!

00:20:40.830 --> 00:20:44.660
Why don't you go run off
and return to Arts already?

00:20:44.660 --> 00:20:46.830
He'll be delighted, I'm sure.

00:20:46.830 --> 00:20:51.750
Th-That's right! Lord Arts!
Sambo is coming back to serve you!

00:20:55.830 --> 00:20:58.910
I'm so sorry for the ruckus we've caused.

00:20:58.910 --> 00:21:02.000
I'll pay for all the trouble in his place.

00:21:02.000 --> 00:21:05.660
This is... a holy lambda coin...

00:21:05.660 --> 00:21:07.830
Its value depends on the market,

00:21:07.830 --> 00:21:12.290
but I've heard they're worth
100 giant gold coins at the least.

00:21:12.290 --> 00:21:14.200
"Holy Lambda Coin"
"Giant Gold Coin = 2,000,000 yen
x 100 = 200,000,000 yen"

00:21:15.080 --> 00:21:16.790
Are you sure about this?

00:21:16.790 --> 00:21:22.950
It's fine. That stubborn old blockhead
is indebted to me thanks to you.

00:21:22.950 --> 00:21:28.250
That's worth much more to me
than any number of holy lambda coins.

00:21:28.250 --> 00:21:30.700
Then, if you insist...

00:21:30.700 --> 00:21:34.450
I have a feeling you and I
will develop a great relationship.

00:21:34.450 --> 00:21:37.660
Oh, what a coincidence. I thought so too.

00:21:59.000 --> 00:22:01.700
<i>"I wish I could go back"</i>

00:22:01.700 --> 00:22:04.410
<i>Is what someone said</i>

00:22:04.410 --> 00:22:09.200
<i>But I don't have a past</i>

00:22:09.200 --> 00:22:12.200
<i>For eternity</i>

00:22:12.200 --> 00:22:14.700
<i>That nothing would change</i>

00:22:14.700 --> 00:22:19.450
<i>Is what I thought</i>

00:22:19.450 --> 00:22:22.250
<i>Over and over </i>

00:22:22.250 --> 00:22:25.580
<i>Rubbing my eyes to make sure</i>

00:22:25.580 --> 00:22:29.660
<i>I'm overwhelmed by emotion</i>

00:22:29.660 --> 00:22:32.910
<i>Like a lie</i>
<i>Bright! Still locked up</i>

00:22:32.910 --> 00:22:35.790
<i>Hiding what I couldn't give up</i>

00:22:35.790 --> 00:22:39.950
<i>That miracle lit up by my heart</i>

00:22:39.950 --> 00:22:43.160
<i>Not sought out, not doubted</i>

00:22:43.160 --> 00:22:46.120
<i>But still you believed</i>

00:22:46.120 --> 00:22:50.540
<i>As if to teach me</i>

00:22:50.540 --> 00:22:56.370
<i>RE NEW ME</i>
<i>Now that I'm laughing with you</i>

00:22:56.370 --> 00:23:03.290
<i>I can embrace it all</i>

00:23:03.290 --> 00:23:09.040
<i>Once again</i>

00:23:17.540 --> 00:23:23.330
Tahara. How do you feel about being
unable to meet your little sister here?

00:23:23.330 --> 00:23:25.500
Manami...

00:23:25.500 --> 00:23:28.870
Manami!

00:23:28.870 --> 00:23:29.750
Uh...

00:23:29.750 --> 00:23:33.870
It's fine! With us running
a business like we're in the Yakuza,

00:23:33.870 --> 00:23:36.410
it's better that she's not around!

00:23:36.410 --> 00:23:39.910
That's Tahara for you.
Talk about sister complex.

00:23:39.910 --> 00:23:42.290
What's sister complex mean?

00:23:42.290 --> 00:23:46.910
Next time, <i>Demon Lord, Retry</i>
Episode 10. "Madam Roars."
